{"id":"76a17cf51da75e1a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Chain Map","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map — ZFC Algebra2 Chain Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map — ZFC Algebra2 Chain Map","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","[[58-df-homomorphism.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map — ZFC Algebra2 Chain Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md\">../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism.md\">58-df-homomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D \\in V\">\\(f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S \\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S \\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}chain\\text{-}map}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S(f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+_C,d_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(D,+_D,d_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}D(n)^{C(n)})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f(n),C(n),+_C(n),D(n),+_D(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;\nd_D(n)(f(n)(x))=f(n-1)(d_C(n)(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}chain\\text{-}map}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S(f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+_C,d_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(D,+_D,d_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}D(n)^{C(n)})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f(n),C(n),+_C(n),D(n),+_D(n))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;\nd_D(n)(f(n)(x))=f(n-1)(d_C(n)(x)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A chain map is a degreewise group homomorphism commuting with both differentials.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-chain-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S \\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}chain\\text{-}map}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S(f,C,+_C,d_C,D,+_D,d_D)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+_C,d_C)\n\\land\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(D,+_D,d_D)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathbb Z,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb Z}D(n)^{C(n)})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f(n),C(n),+_C(n),D(n),+_D(n))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\forall x\\in C(n)\\;\nd_D(n)(f(n)(x))=f(n-1)(d_C(n)(x)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1192,"backlinks":[{"id":"434d3c43afd7cf17","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ChainMap}_S\\subseteq V^7$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1418","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map.md|58-df-zfc-algebra2-chain-map]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["c3537edf2017d84e","f32a973b59a825e4","36d7463d215be751"]}